  hardware:"Select the physical ESP32 board and GPIO capabilities here. A custom profile describes pinout only; the user remains responsible for electrical correctness.",
  tx:"The TX interlock blocks antenna and timed switching while an external TX signal is active. It is an additional protection layer and does not replace safe RF hardware interlocking.",
